<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		VQE Ancients' ancient organ box (loot table VQEA_AncientOrganBox, any item in the BodyParts category) is capped at
		Industrial tech: no bionic, ultratech, archotech or mechtech parts, so no psylink neuroformers, mechlinks or mechanitor
		implants. The cap keeps every item at or below Industrial, and natural organs have no tech level, so hearts, kidneys
		and the like still drop. Only this loot table is touched; the box's 1000~5000 value and 1~3 count are unchanged.
		The few below-Industrial parts are excluded by name: EPOE-Forked's medieval hook hand and steel arm, Anima Animals'
		neolithic anima heart, and the whole Anima Bionics - Forked set (neolithic anima parts and the two dryads). Each
		entry is MayRequire'd on its mod.
		Animal implants are out too (2026-11-18): Alpha Implants' whole animal parts category (AI_ImplantCategory), and
		Vanilla Genetics Expanded's 31 "animal Implant:" parts plus More Lab Stuff's animal mind controller, by name. VGE's
		"human Implant:" hybrids share that category (GR_ImplantCategory) and stay, as do Alpha Animals' mutant parts
		(they go on people). Bionic modularity - animals is all Spacer, so the cap already removes it.
		Verified 2026-11-18 against VQE Ancients (its 1.6 folder, which it also loads on 1.7): the table's MarketValue maker has
		fixedParams with only a BodyParts filter. Checked in the 1.7 decompile: ThingSetMaker.ApplyFixedParams keeps the
		table's own fixed values over the ones VEF's LootableBuilding_Custom passes in, and
		ThingSetMakerUtility.GetAllowedThingDefs drops defs whose techLevel is above parms.techLevel.
		Tech levels were read from every def in the 2026-11-18 mod list; the only Neolithic/Medieval body parts were these.
		Items with no tech level (natural organs and some modded parts) still pass the cap.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs/ThingSetMakerDef[defName="VQEA_AncientOrganBox"]//fixedParams[filter/categories/li="BodyParts"]</xpath>
		<value>
			<techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
		</value>
	</Operation>
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs/ThingSetMakerDef[defName="VQEA_AncientOrganBox"]//fixedParams[filter/categories/li="BodyParts"]/filter</xpath>
